Achmage Workbench — rhwp v0.9.0 form of a 0.8.7 engine patch (third_party/hop/patches-0.9.0).
Origin: Ieum 0020 (vendor/ieumoffice/vendor/rhwp-core/patches/0020-topbottom-float-anchor-flow.patch, sha256 9a6143c6977863c61e7097c5c250bb7383ca88d2069eb6b60c2b51b65dccff78; original author pblsketch <239486537+pblsketch@users.noreply.github.com>)
Status: ported
Differs from the 0.8.7 form: part 1 only, in 0.9.0 form: upstream #7696 already moves what follows below a page/paper-anchored top-and-bottom box but registers the box after its anchor paragraph; register_anchor_own_page_topbottom_bands registers it before the anchor's fit (boxes reaching the body bottom excepted). Parts 2-3 (stale stored page boundaries) not carried: 0.9.0 already ignores the stale restart in the fixture. Adds Ieum's fixture as src/renderer/typeset/testdata/ieum-0020-paper-topbottom-box-stale-ladder.hwpx. H4b: only an anchor paragraph WITHOUT visible text is registered early (a text anchor keeps the lines Hangul stored inside the band: samples/issue5941 roadmap 303 -> 302 pages = Hancom print), and the two 0.8.7 conditions the first port dropped are back (object top in the upper third of the column; no move when the anchor lines fit above the first object). Review M1 (H4b review, release unit D): "visible text" = a character that is not white space and not a control (upstream para_has_visible_text counts a space), so an anchor holding only spaces (U+0020, U+3000, U+00A0) is laid out as the empty one; adds the space-only variant of the fixture (only the anchor run changed) as src/renderer/typeset/testdata/ieum-0020-paper-topbottom-box-space-anchor.hwpx.
Regression test: ieum_0020_paper_topbottom_box_moves_its_anchor_and_what_follows_below_it (new, Ieum's vitest assertions in Rust; 33/17 lines without the change, 32/18 with it); vendor/ieumoffice/apps/hwp/tests/engine-layout.test.ts against the WASM; ieum_0020_text_anchor_keeps_its_stored_lines_roadmap_302_pages (new in H4b; needs a full checkout with samples/); ieum_0020_space_only_anchor_is_laid_out_as_the_empty_one (new, review M1: 17 lines on page 2 without the fix, 18 with it) and apps/host/src/hwp-anchor-space.test.ts against the WASM (spaces, tab, U+3000/U+00A0, real text)

